WEBVTT

00:03.560 --> 00:11.560
In the garden of the fierce Fudo Myoo, maidens gather with pure smiles resembling ambassadors of the Shinsengumi, crossing the Tama River's flow.

00:13.080 --> 00:17.300
Dressed in pristine white uniforms, they take care to keep their pleated skirts neat

00:17.890 --> 00:28.080
and their blue sailor collars from fluttering as they walk slowly, the proper etiquette here.

00:28.760 --> 00:30.570
This is Toritsu Hinominami High School.

00:31.150 --> 00:34.230
Here, maidens' gardens, astonishingly beautiful.

00:35.110 --> 00:36.200
Good morning,

00:36.530 --> 00:37.880
viewers.

02:17.010 --> 02:21.970
Girl Meets Deer.

02:23.730 --> 02:25.650
It's still cold, isn't it?

02:25.880 --> 02:27.780
And it rained yesterday.

02:31.310 --> 02:33.140
Be careful, it's slippery.

02:33.700 --> 02:34.810
Are you okay?

02:36.980 --> 02:38.950
Thank you! Thank you very much!

02:40.850 --> 02:42.090
You're welcome.

02:45.830 --> 02:46.970
This is Koshi Torako,

02:47.130 --> 02:49.430
a second-year student at Tokyo Metropolitan Hinominami High School,

02:49.620 --> 02:52.870
student council president and class representative of 2-B.

02:52.900 --> 02:57.510
Beautiful, brilliant, and athletic.

02:57.830 --> 03:01.390
She's known not only at school but also in the neighborhood as the perfect girl.

03:01.520 --> 03:03.060
Wonderful!

03:06.760 --> 03:08.170
According to plan.

03:08.700 --> 03:14.290
Koshi Torako, who enjoys a smooth and perfect high school life, has a secret she can't tell anyone.

03:14.550 --> 03:17.650
She used to be a delinquent.

03:17.850 --> 03:21.330
I was known as the Beast of Hino in Tokyo!

03:21.740 --> 03:25.120
A past of being a delinquent influenced by shonen manga.

03:25.860 --> 03:31.940
If this secret were revealed, all the effort she put into becoming an honor student since her high school debut would go to waste!

03:32.490 --> 03:36.390
Well, my disguise is perfect, so there's no way I'll be found out.

03:36.900 --> 03:38.840
That's what she thought.

03:39.090 --> 03:40.820
Until today.

03:50.410 --> 03:53.370
I can't believe this happened in the first episode!

03:53.690 --> 03:55.350
Thank goodness it's a late-night anime!

03:55.380 --> 03:57.770
Well, not really. P-Police?

03:57.870 --> 03:58.520
A show?

03:58.810 --> 03:59.860
Kodak?

03:59.900 --> 04:03.830
No. Hajime-chan!

04:08.320 --> 04:09.830
Huh, alive?

04:10.190 --> 04:11.200
What's going on?

04:11.350 --> 04:14.070
If it’s not a suicide, why are you hanging there?

04:14.840 --> 04:15.960
Horns on your head?

04:16.350 --> 04:18.130
Ah, not Tokyo.

04:18.190 --> 04:20.280
Is it those things they sell at that mouse place in Chiba?

04:20.310 --> 04:22.620
But if it were, it would have fallen off, right?

04:22.970 --> 04:25.000
So, real horns?

04:25.160 --> 04:29.590
And these are probably deer antlers. Are those okay for deer?

04:29.930 --> 04:33.390
If so, only male deer have antlers, right?

04:33.640 --> 04:35.110
A new type of cryptid?

04:35.150 --> 04:37.720
Or a villain from an evil organization?

04:37.930 --> 04:40.080
And the snot is incredible.

04:40.220 --> 04:41.450
Temperature is 12 degrees.

04:42.300 --> 04:43.750
Surely!

04:43.800 --> 04:48.500
While I was thinking that, animals mistook her for dead meat and started swarming!

04:49.830 --> 04:50.730
Do you want to fight?

04:51.210 --> 04:52.940
Do you want to fight, huh?!

04:52.970 --> 04:58.010
Why are you picking a fight in this situation? Shouldn't you help me instead?

05:03.820 --> 05:05.740
Oh, she's staring intensely!

05:06.040 --> 05:07.420
Such pressure from their gaze!

05:07.680 --> 05:10.040
Getting involved in this would make me late!

05:10.290 --> 05:13.350
For an honor student like me, that's absolutely unacceptable!

05:13.710 --> 05:17.920
I'll pretend I didn't notice and hurry to school!

05:18.230 --> 05:19.620
You're abandoning me.

05:20.180 --> 05:23.050
You're abandoning me, who is in this predicament.

05:23.190 --> 05:25.890
I-I'm not really abandoning you!

05:26.120 --> 05:29.570
I mean, you’re the one who’s hanging there on your own!

05:29.890 --> 05:33.240
I’m in a hurry. I don’t have time to play around!

05:33.320 --> 05:38.680
Tomorrow’s news: "Hino City high school girl found hanging from a power line, dead."

05:40.030 --> 05:44.830
Every morning on my way to school, I’ll be reminded of your face.

05:46.340 --> 05:48.200
If only I had helped back then?

05:48.230 --> 05:51.270
And I’ll be plagued by regret for the rest of my life.

05:52.460 --> 05:55.650
Fine, I got it!

05:57.210 --> 05:58.660
Seikan!

05:58.840 --> 06:00.910
This girl is so heavy!

06:01.160 --> 06:02.650
Hey!

06:02.740 --> 06:05.910
Why were you up there?

06:06.310 --> 06:08.930
When I woke up, I was already there.

06:09.090 --> 06:09.800
Why?

06:09.930 --> 06:11.190
Seriously, why?

06:11.470 --> 06:14.100
Anyway, thanks for helping me.

06:14.190 --> 06:15.650
Miss Delinquent.

06:16.740 --> 06:20.470
It's nothing, really. Miss Delinquent?

06:21.810 --> 06:23.460
Who's a delinquent?

06:23.520 --> 06:24.530
What?

06:25.330 --> 06:27.000
What are you talking about?

06:27.190 --> 06:30.760
I’m the one who’s called beautiful, elegant, and charming when standing or sitting, right?

06:30.950 --> 06:32.390
Delinquent?

06:32.600 --> 06:34.780
Impossible!

06:34.980 --> 06:36.230
I see.

06:37.020 --> 06:39.990
Hmm, but it suits you.

06:40.290 --> 06:41.130
What suits me?

06:41.270 --> 06:42.940
The antlers are reacting too.

06:45.500 --> 06:47.450
What kind of construction is that?

06:47.970 --> 06:50.310
It’s dangerous to stay with her any longer.

06:50.380 --> 06:52.610
It must be a mistake.

06:52.730 --> 06:54.290
Maybe you got the wrong person.

06:54.680 --> 06:56.710
Oh, I have to go now.

06:56.910 --> 06:59.480
Try not to get stuck up there again.

06:59.830 --> 07:00.970
That was close.

07:01.470 --> 07:05.510
My character creation should be perfect. So why?

07:11.530 --> 07:13.320
Who was that girl anyway?

07:12.190 --> 07:14.060
Everyone, take your seats.

07:16.570 --> 07:19.640
Today, we have a new transfer student.

07:21.320 --> 07:22.550
A transfer student?

07:22.870 --> 07:24.950
I have a bad feeling about this.

07:25.410 --> 07:26.650
Come in.

07:26.840 --> 07:27.920
Hi.

07:31.100 --> 07:32.810
I knew it!

07:34.230 --> 07:34.910
What?

07:35.320 --> 07:37.240
Hanging again?

07:37.280 --> 07:38.320
Learn your lesson!

08:20.140 --> 08:21.740
No way!

08:22.100 --> 08:24.680
Now, Shikanoko-san, please introduce yourself.

08:24.710 --> 08:25.210
Noko!

08:25.550 --> 08:28.350
I’m Shikanoko Noko. Call me Nokotan.

08:28.720 --> 08:30.740
Nokotan!

08:31.210 --> 08:33.270
Hehe, what a funny girl.

08:33.490 --> 08:34.800
Deer, huh?

08:35.520 --> 08:37.450
Why are they welcoming her so normally?

08:37.490 --> 08:38.730
Is everyone crazy?

08:38.940 --> 08:42.310
There's an empty seat next to Koshi-san.

08:43.710 --> 08:44.970
Typical school story.

08:45.200 --> 08:47.190
There’s conveniently an empty seat.

08:47.590 --> 08:48.430
This is bad.

08:48.470 --> 08:52.920
If she starts saying strange things, my high school life could be ruined.

08:53.410 --> 08:55.130
I need to take the initiative.

08:55.200 --> 08:56.860
Oh, good day.

08:57.060 --> 08:58.240
Oh, it's you.

08:58.760 --> 09:00.710
So, you're the transfer student.

09:01.120 --> 09:02.470
I'm Koshi Torako.

09:02.650 --> 09:05.210
If you have any questions, feel free to ask.

09:05.410 --> 09:06.650
Thank you!

09:07.960 --> 09:09.960
It seems like I can get through this without any problems.

09:10.170 --> 09:12.960
Looks like there was nothing to worry about.

09:13.970 --> 09:16.250
You can call me whatever you like.

09:16.270 --> 09:17.520
Whatever I like?

09:17.590 --> 09:19.620
It was all just my overthinking.

09:19.640 --> 09:20.760
Got it!

09:21.030 --> 09:22.300
Delinquent lady!

09:22.640 --> 09:23.880
Delinquent lady!

09:23.900 --> 09:25.280
Delinquent lady!

09:25.320 --> 09:26.620
Delinquent lady!

09:49.570 --> 09:52.370
Thank you, delinquent lady!

09:52.550 --> 09:54.240
Koshi-san is a delinquent!

09:54.320 --> 09:55.890
No way, Koshi-san!

09:58.630 --> 10:02.460
How come she reacts to the deer transfer student but not to this?!

10:03.080 --> 10:05.870
No, no, what's this about being a delinquent?

10:05.910 --> 10:07.540
Stop making baseless accusations.

10:07.990 --> 10:11.270
My wild instincts tell me you're a delinquent.

10:11.310 --> 10:12.730
You're wild, aren't you!

10:13.390 --> 10:15.550
And you're calling me a lady.

10:19.040 --> 10:20.630
And the antlers are reacting too.

10:20.640 --> 10:22.840
What's up with that system!

10:22.890 --> 10:24.410
Koshi-san is a lady...

10:24.490 --> 10:27.180
So Koshi-san is... really?!

10:27.410 --> 10:29.490
Shut up, Gaia!

10:30.240 --> 10:33.710
Wh-Wh-What's your proof of me being a lady?

10:34.760 --> 10:36.660
So, you're not a lady?

10:46.460 --> 10:48.470
Well, that's... um...

10:48.540 --> 10:50.510
Confirmed lady!

11:01.440 --> 11:02.380
Young lady!

11:02.740 --> 11:04.390
You're beautiful today too!

11:07.620 --> 11:12.360
I almost showed my ugly side earlier, but I'm doing well now.

11:12.680 --> 11:14.380
However, I can't let my guard down.

11:14.790 --> 11:20.170
I must make sure the deer doesn’t reveal my secret of being a former delinquent.

11:20.560 --> 11:25.770
Before she says anything strange, I need to take the initiative... huh?

11:28.490 --> 11:31.190
My desk is covered in snacks!?

11:32.830 --> 11:34.730
No, it's those Juju No-Bia!

11:34.920 --> 11:35.940
Deer crackers!

11:36.030 --> 11:37.390
Deer crackers!

11:37.690 --> 11:41.440
Known as the soul food of Nara Prefecture, although this is debatable.

11:41.800 --> 11:46.620
Students on school trips try them as a joke, but the taste is often just okay.

11:46.910 --> 11:50.280
The reactions from those around are usually mixed.

11:50.460 --> 11:52.330
I'm not doing this.

12:05.230 --> 12:06.620
This can only be her.

12:07.150 --> 12:08.440
Drooling?

12:08.650 --> 12:09.690
Are you a Merlion?

12:10.400 --> 12:14.390
Um, Shikanoko-san, what’s this all about?

12:14.750 --> 12:16.210
It’s... my thanks?

12:16.250 --> 12:17.680
You don't look very thankful!

12:18.120 --> 12:22.380
You helped me this morning, right?

12:22.480 --> 12:23.930
This is my thanks.

12:24.680 --> 12:28.210
Oh, it was nothing, no need for thanks.

12:28.600 --> 12:31.130
Oh, not satisfied with deer crackers?

12:31.470 --> 12:33.570
No, that’s not the issue.

12:34.070 --> 12:36.570
Why the sudden superiority?

12:36.650 --> 12:39.080
Then I'll give you my antlers as a special gift.

12:39.120 --> 12:40.230
They can come off?!

12:40.740 --> 12:42.900
Here you go. I don't need them!

12:43.330 --> 12:45.750
By the way, they are edible. Yep.

12:48.600 --> 12:50.150
They do have a taste, though.

12:50.200 --> 12:51.340
I won't eat them.

12:51.500 --> 12:53.570
They're really hard and chewy.

12:53.640 --> 12:55.610
One of those things you force yourself to eat!

12:56.220 --> 12:59.560
If you insist, it's a special deal.

12:59.580 --> 13:00.840
I said I don't need them!

13:01.110 --> 13:06.270
I mean, as strange as it sounds coming from me,

13:06.430 --> 13:09.690
without the antlers, you’d just be a regular high school girl!

13:10.070 --> 13:14.760
For my lifesaver, I can even abandon my character!

13:14.790 --> 13:16.960
You're heavy, and abandoning your character too quickly!

13:17.020 --> 13:18.360
It's still the first episode.

13:18.610 --> 13:20.040
No to deer crackers.

13:20.080 --> 13:21.310
No to antlers.

13:22.780 --> 13:24.230
I'm sticking with it.

13:25.220 --> 13:27.290
Could it be that the lady wants...

13:27.790 --> 13:28.680
Punishment!

13:30.220 --> 13:32.340
Why all the deer fixation!?

13:32.340 --> 13:33.450
Understand me!

13:33.570 --> 13:34.730
Just eat it!

13:34.760 --> 13:35.740
I won’t eat it!

13:35.930 --> 13:37.350
Who are these people!?

13:37.430 --> 13:40.560
I have nothing else to give!

13:41.070 --> 13:43.430
See, I don't even have money.

13:43.670 --> 13:45.720
Still got deer crackers?

13:47.250 --> 13:50.020
Please, no more!

13:50.330 --> 13:53.090
Why does it look like I'm extorting you!?

13:53.190 --> 13:54.430
And for deer crackers, no less!

13:56.040 --> 13:58.310
Oh no, I’m running late!

13:58.630 --> 14:01.480
Hey, Nokotan. Are you and Koshi-san friends?

14:01.740 --> 14:03.620
You seemed close this morning.

14:05.030 --> 14:06.520
Nokotan?

14:09.050 --> 14:10.570
It's my nickname.

14:10.780 --> 14:11.890
How cute.

14:12.200 --> 14:13.190
It's so annoying.

14:13.640 --> 14:16.660
Actually, this morning, when I was stuck on the utility pole, this girl...

14:16.690 --> 14:17.530
Shikanoko-san!

14:17.630 --> 14:19.840
The teacher was calling for you!

14:19.850 --> 14:21.860
Do not run in the school hallways

14:23.030 --> 14:27.170
Oh, Koshi-tan, you suddenly dragged me here...

14:26.150 --> 14:27.780
Out of order. Student counsil.

14:28.270 --> 14:29.370
So bold.

14:29.560 --> 14:31.880
What are you imagining?!

14:32.070 --> 14:35.700
What were you imagining, Koshi-tan?

14:37.340 --> 14:40.570
N-Nothing like that... Ah

14:40.950 --> 14:41.860
Koshi-tan.

14:43.120 --> 14:43.970
So pure.

14:44.000 --> 14:45.240
Shut up!

14:45.350 --> 14:47.860
And what's with this "Koshi-tan"?

14:48.150 --> 14:49.230
It's a nickname.

14:49.330 --> 14:51.800
Nokotan and Koshi-tan, sounds good, right?

14:52.100 --> 14:53.130
Are we a comedy duo or something?!

14:53.410 --> 14:56.240
Stop giving me nicknames without asking!

14:56.460 --> 14:58.020
Then, delinquent la…

14:58.040 --> 14:59.040
Koshi-tan is fine.

14:59.160 --> 15:00.110
Good, she agreed.

15:02.760 --> 15:05.270
But that's not the issue here.

15:05.890 --> 15:07.510
My secret identity.

15:07.650 --> 15:11.640
You must promise not to tell anyone. Got it?

15:12.380 --> 15:17.730
At school, I’m known as an honor student. If my true identity is revealed, it will cause many problems.

15:21.320 --> 15:24.280
If you talk, there will be consequences.

15:25.170 --> 15:26.760
Understand?

15:28.700 --> 15:29.700
My true identity.

15:30.720 --> 15:33.320
So you're saying you is really a virgin?

15:33.360 --> 15:34.110
No, I'm not!

15:34.200 --> 15:36.210
But no, that's not it!

15:36.590 --> 15:40.700
Damn it, she's been mocking me this whole time. Stop it already!

15:40.830 --> 15:42.780
Enough with the jokes about antlers!

15:46.490 --> 15:47.800
Yeah, right.

15:47.980 --> 15:50.520
These antlers are weird, aren't they?

15:53.140 --> 15:54.280
Well, no.

15:54.910 --> 15:58.780
A girl with antlers is creepy after all.

15:59.530 --> 16:02.280
And calling me a deer is strange too.

16:02.500 --> 16:04.580
I'm sorry if I hurt your feelings.

16:04.940 --> 16:05.940
I see.

16:06.360 --> 16:11.110
She's probably been teased about her appearance a lot. And I...

16:11.850 --> 16:15.860
This isn't just failing as an honor student, it's failing as a human being!

16:16.760 --> 16:17.840
S-Sorry!

16:17.940 --> 16:20.090
You can keep the antlers!

16:20.810 --> 16:23.030
With that, it seems like everything's okay.

16:24.340 --> 16:28.520
I’m too scared to ask how far the antlers go, though.

16:31.940 --> 16:34.170
I’m exhausted already and it’s still morning.

16:34.540 --> 16:37.420
I need to go home quickly and prepare for tomorrow’s lessons.

16:39.140 --> 16:40.360
What was that noise?

16:41.270 --> 16:42.270
It came from over there.

16:47.960 --> 16:49.800
That was a loud sound. Are you okay?

16:56.110 --> 16:57.400
Police!

16:57.450 --> 16:58.230
Watch out!

16:58.280 --> 16:59.010
Clunk!

16:59.120 --> 17:00.970
Over there, help!

17:01.510 --> 17:02.600
Oh, Koshi-tan.

17:04.040 --> 17:09.180
Shi-Shikanoko-san. Wh-What happened?

17:09.590 --> 17:11.560
Oh, just a little accident.

17:11.710 --> 17:14.360
I fell off a stepladder and scraped my knee.

17:28.600 --> 17:31.320
No, your head!

17:33.120 --> 17:34.880
How cute, a patch with hearts.

17:35.130 --> 17:35.970
Shut up.

17:36.200 --> 17:38.050
What are you doing here?

17:38.260 --> 17:40.070
In an unused warehouse?

17:40.370 --> 17:42.140
Just cleaning.

17:42.390 --> 17:43.110
Cleaning?

17:43.290 --> 17:44.310
All by yourself?

17:45.600 --> 17:47.130
Thanks, Koshi-tan.

17:47.540 --> 17:49.630
Alright, let’s resume cleaning.

17:57.240 --> 17:59.660
Ugh, fine, I’ll help you.

18:00.250 --> 18:01.330
R-Really?

18:01.640 --> 18:03.290
You’re injured.

18:03.450 --> 18:06.370
And I can’t leave you alone, who knows what you’ll do.

18:06.900 --> 18:07.670
Yay!

18:07.920 --> 18:08.870
Thank you!

18:09.130 --> 18:11.350
An undeniable tsundere.

18:19.860 --> 18:23.030
You sure are enjoying this menial task.

18:23.240 --> 18:25.190
Because I’m doing it with you, Koshi-tan.

18:25.230 --> 18:26.000
Wha-!

18:26.510 --> 18:27.880
You’re exaggerating!

18:28.040 --> 18:29.250
It’s just cleaning.

18:29.350 --> 18:33.220
Cleaning with someone else is so much fun.

18:36.590 --> 18:38.520
Wow, it’s looking really clean.

18:37.690 --> 18:38.130
Oh!

18:38.590 --> 18:39.780
Ms. Ukoi?

18:39.950 --> 18:41.030
Hello, Nokko!

18:42.000 --> 18:43.400
Yes, hello, Nokko.

18:43.800 --> 18:45.630
Koshi-san helped you, didn't she?

18:45.730 --> 18:47.950
Thank you. Was it hard?

18:48.140 --> 18:49.510
No, not at all.

18:49.570 --> 18:50.710
I'm fine.

18:50.970 --> 18:54.160
I'm relieved to know Koshi-san will join the Deer Club.

18:54.590 --> 18:56.330
Yes, indeed.

18:57.470 --> 18:58.310
Deer Club?

18:58.720 --> 19:02.160
Then, as promised, you can use this place freely.

19:02.230 --> 19:03.090
Yay!

19:03.200 --> 19:05.720
Wait, what is the Deer Club?

19:05.900 --> 19:09.560
And why am I joining? Oh, you didn't hear?

19:09.720 --> 19:12.150
I started the Deer Club.

19:12.330 --> 19:15.640
What kind of club has never been seen before?

19:15.790 --> 19:19.950
We promised that if we cleaned this place, we could use it freely.

19:21.840 --> 19:23.830
That's not the point! That's not the point!

19:23.970 --> 19:28.170
And joining such a ridiculous club would be a disaster!

19:28.640 --> 19:29.920
But I’m relieved.

19:30.160 --> 19:33.000
Koshi-san is reliable and caring.

19:33.040 --> 19:34.280
She’s trustworthy!

19:34.480 --> 19:38.850
She's bright and kind, so it’ll be a fun club.

19:38.870 --> 19:40.440
A homey club!

19:41.830 --> 19:44.660
She's smart, so we might win some awards.

19:44.700 --> 19:46.520
Inter-high National Tournament!

19:48.370 --> 19:52.610
With Koshi-san joining, the Deer Club will definitely be a success!

19:52.710 --> 19:54.190
Leave it to me!

19:54.510 --> 19:56.310
Koshi-san was easy to convince.

19:56.790 --> 19:59.730
So, Shikanoko-san, write up the club application.

20:01.800 --> 20:05.260
Club name: Deer Club. Club president: Koshi Torako.

20:05.320 --> 20:08.790
Activity: Mainly taking care of deer.

20:08.810 --> 20:09.990
Wait a minute!

20:10.040 --> 20:12.140
Why am I the club president?

20:12.340 --> 20:13.920
The president should be you!

20:14.590 --> 20:16.760
Why does this feel so wrong?

20:16.840 --> 20:18.370
Because it’s the Deer Club!

20:18.650 --> 20:21.920
If Shikanoko the Deer doesn’t become the president, who will?

20:22.330 --> 20:24.170
Oh, I see.

20:24.510 --> 20:29.020
The club’s activity is mainly taking care of deer, right?

20:30.820 --> 20:34.230
Since I’ll be the deer owned by the Deer Club.

20:34.250 --> 20:35.520
Deer owned by the Deer Club?

20:36.170 --> 20:38.190
The person in charge of taking care of the deer is the president!

20:38.350 --> 20:39.440
So, it's you, Koshi-tan!

20:39.640 --> 20:44.250
This is unacceptable! What kind of school is this, an agricultural school?

20:45.080 --> 20:47.240
Alright. Submitted!

20:47.310 --> 20:47.880
Okay.

20:48.230 --> 20:49.730
I officially accept it.

20:50.530 --> 20:51.940
So fast!

20:52.150 --> 20:53.430
Well then, President.

20:53.520 --> 20:56.000
Take care of Shikanoko-san!

20:56.030 --> 20:57.430
Leave it to me!

20:59.050 --> 21:00.010
Yes.

21:00.390 --> 21:05.480
I said it with such confidence, I can’t argue back now.

21:07.100 --> 21:10.090
Deer Club! Yay!

21:10.360 --> 21:14.280
Unexpected things happened in just one day.

21:14.470 --> 21:17.030
I’ll bring deer crackers tomorrow too!

21:19.370 --> 21:21.020
Well, whatever.

21:21.450 --> 21:24.240
First, I’ll ask you to do some brushing.

21:24.450 --> 21:26.460
You’ve got to be kidding me!

21:26.870 --> 21:28.600
What’s this brush that looks like a scrubbing brush?

21:28.870 --> 21:30.480
It’s for animals.

21:32.160 --> 21:35.320
Ugh, fine!

21:35.370 --> 21:36.120
A rock!

21:36.880 --> 21:38.830
Grr, why do I have to do this?

21:47.940 --> 21:51.690
Will I have to do this every time from now on?

21:54.820 --> 21:58.470
Rrrr, guh, itchyyyy.

21:58.690 --> 22:00.070
S-Scary!

22:00.250 --> 22:04.860
Whatever happens, the battle of the Deer Club has just begun!
